OL,3,GNEWSAPyrotechnic vicar Rev Ron
OL,4,ALancaster dies aged 95
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vicar and retired chemistry teacher
OL,7,Fwho was behind some of the nation's
OL,8,Fmost incredible fireworks displays has
OL,9,Fdied at the age of 95.
OL,11,FThe Reverend Ron Lancaster MBE founded
OL,12,FKimbolton Fireworks in 1964, creating
OL,13,Fdisplays for the 2012 London Olympics
OL,14,Fand the capital's New Year's Eve
OL,15,Fcelebrations.
OL,17,FKnown as the "Master Blaster Pastor",
OL,18,FLancaster was honoured for "services to
OL,19,Fpyrotechnics" with a plaque in 2013 by
OL,20,Fthe Royal Society of Chemistry.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
