OL,3,GNEWSAPyrotechnic vicar Rev Ron
OL,4,ALancaster dies aged 95
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhoenix Fireworks, which took on the
OL,7,Ffirm, said in a statement: "A true
OL,8,Fpioneer of the British fireworks
OL,9,Findustry, his passion, dedication and
OL,10,Fvision helped establish Kimbolton
OL,11,FFireworks as one of the most recognised
OL,12,Fand respected names in pyrotechnics."
